@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] deterministic-racing-draws
Valid draws MUST be stateless, depend only on seed/tag/range, and retain the reference
UTF-16 hash and JSON-string key semantics. Draws MUST use rejection sampling rather than
biased modulo alone. Checked APIs MUST reject nonpositive or oversized bounds, negative
weights and overflowing/zero weight sums without changing the output. Internal checked
convenience calls MUST fail explicitly on invalid arguments in every build, never hang
or produce a fallback draw. Untrusted values MUST use the nonfatal checked APIs.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:architecture] racing-rules-boundary
Rules MUST remain independent of game names, actors, UI and rendering assets. A game owns
its presentation, authored venue data, runtime authority and persistence admission.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] racing-value-arithmetic
Horse value structures MUST NOT be treated as admitted external state. Their arithmetic
helpers MUST widen before addition so malformed int32 values cannot cause signed overflow.
Gene-pair indexing MUST reject indices outside 0/1 rather than silently choosing an allele.
Public reflected data structures MUST be exported for consumers in other modules.
